{"4914340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Someone's Here", "steam_appid": 4914340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlists Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e6d57699bfa8f9feb431fe4f992744be.avif?t=1786726830\" width=1184 height=280 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Horror Free To Play</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/592c84ec6fd3f4a0f912305d3d54dc2c.avif?t=1786726830\" width=1156 height=163 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Someone's Here is a short interactive horror experience.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A routine, quiet night in your apartment. What starts with a simple pizza delivery and everyday chores soon turns into a strange night where the barrier between your safety and the outside world depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.poster.avif?t=1786726830\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.webm?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.mp4?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Speak, explore, discover your apartment freely and be mindful of the decisions you make tonight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3e5bc5c504f3f30a42591c1780.poster.avif?t=1786726830\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3e5bc5c504f3f30a42591c1780.webm?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3e5bc5c504f3f30a42591c1780.mp4?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night and keep control inside the house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/937336125a2497d9439a8f75129b9ef9.poster.avif?t=1786726830\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/937336125a2497d9439a8f75129b9ef9.webm?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/937336125a2497d9439a8f75129b9ef9.mp4?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When strangers knock on your door, will you let them in? Every decision you make will alter the outcome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-driven narrative:</strong> Decide who to trust and who to lock out; your choices dictate the course of the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings:</strong> Features distinct endings based on the paths and risks you decide to take. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environment:</strong> Explore your apartment freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense, bite-sized horror story</strong>: Designed to be played and replayed in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Someone's Here is a short interactive horror experience.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A routine, quiet night in your apartment. What starts with a simple pizza delivery and everyday chores soon turns into a strange night where the barrier between your safety and the outside world depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.poster.avif?t=1786726830\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.webm?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/e35965280511a3d5d4ed383bfa7ff63e.mp4?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Speak, explore, discover your apartment freely and be mindful of the decisions you make tonight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3e5bc5c504f3f30a42591c1780.poster.avif?t=1786726830\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3e5bc5c504f3f30a42591c1780.webm?t=1786726830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914340/extras/627e6f3